<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: bone spike -->
  <FH_Bullet_FleshTurret.label>骨刺</FH_Bullet_FleshTurret.label>

  <!-- EN: flesh digester -->
  <FH_FleshDigester.label>警衛觸手中樞</FH_FleshDigester.label>
  <!-- EN: A flesh neural organ responsible for guarding the hive. It activates nearby flesh to lash at intruders, hindering their movement and inflicting damage.\n\nConsumes 4 hive nutrition per day and increases hive activity by 0.02 per hour. -->
  <FH_FleshDigester.description>血肉巢穴中負責警衛的神經中樞器官。它會活性化附近的血肉板塊，當敵人經過這些地面時，就會有觸手生長出來阻礙敵人移動並對其造成傷害。\n\n每日消耗巢穴4營養，每小時提升0.02巢穴活躍。</FH_FleshDigester.description>

  <!-- EN: small flesh digester -->
  <FH_FleshDigesterS.label>警衛觸手</FH_FleshDigesterS.label>
  <!-- EN: A small flesh neural organ responsible for guarding the hive. It activates nearby flesh to lash at intruders, hindering their movement and inflicting damage.\n\nConsumes 0.5 hive nutrition per day. -->
  <FH_FleshDigesterS.description>負責警衛血肉巢穴的小型神經中樞器官。它會活化附近的血肉，使其抽打入侵者、阻礙移動並造成傷害。\n\n每日消耗巢穴0.5營養。</FH_FleshDigesterS.description>

  <!-- EN: fleshmass spitter -->
  <FH_FleshmassSpitter.label>血肉噴吐器</FH_FleshmassSpitter.label>
  <!-- EN: A defensive fleshmass organ that can spit acid long distances. The acid is a natural byproduct of toxins filtered from the surrounding biomass.\n\nConsumes 1 hive nutrition per day. -->
  <FH_FleshmassSpitter.description>可遠距離噴吐酸性涎液的防禦性血肉塊器官。這種酸性涎液是從周圍生物質中過濾出的天然有毒副產物。\n\n每日消耗巢穴1營養。</FH_FleshmassSpitter.description>
  <!-- EN: fleshmass spitter -->
  <FH_FleshmassSpitter.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>血肉噴吐器</FH_FleshmassSpitter.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>

  <!-- EN: flesh burster -->
  <FH_FleshSpreader.label>血肉爆炸器</FH_FleshSpreader.label>
  <!-- EN: A flesh organ made from clusters of high-pressure vesicles and a fragile outer wall. It explodes when triggered by a living creature or hit by bullets, spreading flesh plates across the nearby ground. Since it is hidden in the surrounding terrain, it cannot be placed adjacent to other traps. Animals can sense it when calm. -->
  <FH_FleshSpreader.description>由大量高壓囊泡和脆弱外壁組成的血肉器官。被生物觸發或子彈擊中後會引發爆炸並在附近地面生成血肉板塊。由於它隱藏在周圍的地形中，因此不能與其他陷阱相鄰。動物可以在非狂暴狀態下感知陷阱。</FH_FleshSpreader.description>

  <!-- EN: bone spitter -->
  <FH_FleshTurret.label>骨刺噴吐器</FH_FleshTurret.label>
  <!-- EN: A small, short-ranged defensive fleshmass organ. After prolonged use, it needs a large amount of nutrition to grow replacement bone spikes. -->
  <FH_FleshTurret.description>一種小型、短程的防禦性血肉塊器官。長期使用後需要大量的營養來生產備用骨刺。</FH_FleshTurret.description>
  <!-- EN: bone spike reserves -->
  <FH_FleshTurret.comps.CompHiveNutritionRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>骨刺儲備</FH_FleshTurret.comps.CompHiveNutritionRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: replacement bone spikes -->
  <FH_FleshTurret.comps.CompHiveNutritionRefuelable.fuelLabel>備用骨刺</FH_FleshTurret.comps.CompHiveNutritionRefuelable.fuelLabel>

  <!-- EN: bone spitter -->
  <FH_Gun_FleshTurret.label>骨刺噴吐器</FH_Gun_FleshTurret.label>
  <!-- EN: A simple bone-spitting organ grown to act as a turret weapon. -->
  <FH_Gun_FleshTurret.description>一種作為炮塔武器生長出來的簡易骨刺噴吐器官。</FH_Gun_FleshTurret.description>
  <!-- EN: bone spitter -->
  <FH_Gun_FleshTurret.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>骨刺噴吐器</FH_Gun_FleshTurret.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>

</LanguageData>
